    {
      "id": "b827c82fc34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You can and should alter the text and images as you please — make it be a landing page for your imagination! What you are doing is basing the structure and styling of your landing page on that of one of these others. However, make the content your own – that is the whole point of the exercise. The screenshots below are from one attempt at this and are examples only. There are lots of places to get cool free images if you need content.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "bd471a67e06",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "unsplash.com",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "b5d71f4c60c",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "pixabay.com",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "bc47a32b66d",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "No functionality needs to be implemented. No JS, or any external libraries or CSS frameworks are allowed for this assignment. You can do all of it with just HTML/CSS from scratch. Don’t worry it’ll be fun!",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "b0624f523fc",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Across the two parts of this lab you'll make an HTML and CSS only version of this landing page (no JS allowed). ❗None of the links or functionality needs to be there, it just needs to look good and be laid out properly. Part 1 is structure only — you'll hang the styles on it in Part 2.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "b30a180aa37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "All anchor tags should look like this:",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
